VT@A: 

DW lbl_setA@A
DW lbl_printA@A

.CODE
lbl_printA@A: LOADFP
LOADSP
STOREFP
LOAD 3
LOADREF 4
PUSH lbl_debugPrint@Object
CALL
lbl_final_printA@A: NOP
STOREFP
